	[1006]={ name="Dawn", english="DAVIST", stature="169CM", weight="54KG", blood=1024, birthday={11,17}, jp_voice="白波瀬沙椰", jp_cvid=0, chn_voice="白波瀬沙椰", chn_cvid=1005, life="Adenie is one of the most renowned warriors in Leistance Security Bureau.\n\nShe was once part of Vilatria's Stellar Knights but left for undisclosed reasons.\n\nCurrently residing in Leistance—though she's been here for quite a while, traces of her knightly demeanor can still be seen occasionally in her actions.\n\n[At parties, she could easily be the focus if she wanted. But the truth is, Adenie always sits far in the corner, sipping a drink, occasionally chatting with passersby, or quietly sitting and doing nothing. When emergencies arise, she's the quickest to solve the problem. She embodies all knightly virtues and adheres to knightly principles. It's hard to comprehend why she left Vilatria, why she left Stellar Knights she remains proud of.]", camp=6, hero_type=1, ele_type=3, hero_color=4, location=4, skill_list={1006,100601,100604}, init_skill_list={1006,100601,100604,100680}, inborn_skill={100680,100690}, show_model="4104", model="4104", showQ_model="4104", head="heroHead/hero_head_4104.png", show_weapon=0, img_painting="record_pic_4104.png", basic_attr={
