	[1111]={ name="Kymia", english="Kemia", stature="177CM", weight="85KG", blood=1024, birthday={11,3}, jp_voice="飯富梓", jp_cvid=0, chn_voice="飯富梓", chn_cvid=4605, life="Information about Kymia's past remains scarce, rumors suggest she's a product of a humanoid modification project named [Angel Project], as the first successful result, titled [Michael].\n\nRumors depict her as a merciless task execution machine, perpetually surrounding the [god] she guards, executing every command given by the [god].\n\nBut one day, the angel's wings were ultimately broken, nearly shattered as she fell from the god's throne to the human realm, losing her fighting strength.\n\nThe god saw no use in the angel and abandoned her without hesitation.\n\nLater, the forsaken angel was saved by humans, reborn anew, but lost past memories, like a blank slate.\n\nRumors end here; she is now just Kymia, one striving to live for herself. If you inquire about her goal, she might tell you she's seeking her purpose.\nSimultaneously, she's adapting to current life, learning emotional resilience akin to humans. If you'd like to befriend her, don't hesitate—she'll surely welcome it.", camp=1, hero_type=1, ele_type=0, hero_color=3, location=1, skill_list={1111,111101,111104}, init_skill_list={1111,111101,111104,111180}, inborn_skill={111180,111190}, show_model="1102", model="1102", showQ_model="1102", head="heroHead/hero_head_1102.png", show_weapon=0, img_painting="record_pic_1102.png", basic_attr={
