	[1203]={ name="Catalpa", english="DAVIST", stature="165CM", weight="28.4KG", blood=1024, birthday={11,38}, jp_voice="夏生", jp_cvid=0, chn_voice="夏生", chn_cvid=5405, life="Catalpa is a researcher from the [Incubator] 05 Lab of Selevie.\n\nA maverick, known for her aloof demeanor, utterly untrusting of strangers, was the impression left by Catalpa among colleagues. To them, Catalpa would rather whisper sweet nothings to her enigmatic [plants] in her room than indulge in polite chit-chat during meetings. Others frequently spotted Catalpa eating instant foods while documenting observation notes of the plant gathered from the Void Expanse on a cluttered desk.\n\n[Although Catalpa seems unsocial, the records she shared are the most detailed I've seen, detailed enough for suspicions she stood before carnivorous aberrations and recorded bit by bit.]\n\n[To be honest, given her age and experience, this feat doesn't seem that odd. She's only 17, when peers at this age are still squabbling in classrooms, she holds herself up in front of research stations delivering speeches, can you demand anything else from her?]\n\n—Sighs from fellow researchers during monthly reports.", camp=7, hero_type=1, ele_type=4, hero_color=3, location=1, skill_list={1203,120301,120304}, init_skill_list={1203,120301,120304,120380}, inborn_skill={120380,120390}, show_model="2104", model="2104", showQ_model="2104", head="heroHead/hero_head_2104.png", show_weapon=0, img_painting="record_pic_2104.png", basic_attr={
